# Trail Cam API

This directory contains the Apache/PHP API implementation for the trail-camera server.

## Deployment

- nginx routes `/trail_cam/` to this directory's `index.php` front controller.
- The `.htaccess` file is only useful if this directory is later served by Apache.
- On this server, nginx exposes the API at `http://192.168.1.42/trail_cam/api/...`.
- The root `/api/...` path is already used by another local service, so trail camera routes are mounted under `/trail_cam/api`.
- MySQL credentials are read from `mysql`.
- Firmware upload routes create their tables lazily on first database use.
- Camera-control routes use `GARDEPRO_BRIDGE_HOST` when set, otherwise `/tmp/gardepro_board_registration.json`.

